Scope of the above grant
------------------------

The MIT licence above covers the code in this repository.

It does not cover the chord data in `data/`. Those voicings originate from
SVGuitar-ChordCollection by TormodKv (https://github.com/TormodKv/SVGuitar-ChordCollection),
itself based on chord-collection by T-vK (https://github.com/T-vK/chord-collection),
neither of which states a licence. No licence is asserted over that data here,
by us or on their behalf — a fingering is a factual description of where fingers
go on a fretboard, and it isn't ours to relicense in any case. If you reuse the
data, please credit those projects.
